     2890     then do:
     2891       ASSIGN
     2892         scr-ship-date :POPUP-MENU in frame Dialog-Frame = MENU m-ed-date26 :HANDLE
     2893         scr-ship-date :MENU-MOUSE in frame Dialog-Frame = 3
     2894       .
